  <item>
    <title>新年特别企划 | 这样的年味，一人吸一口就够了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679cd025247d51713c0d7baf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679cd025247d51713c0d7baf</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 13:47:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好呀，这里是洛阳本地播客《局部乐观》的第10期~我是苏夏🤗🤗🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span>先祝大家新年快乐🎇🎇🎇</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期呢。是一期新年特别企划，也是我除了常规节目之外，第一次做一个挺复杂的声音企划。特别的点，在于新年期间更新，也在于本期节目，一共包含了13位朋友的声音，来通过我准备好的一系列问题，回望2024，展望2025~</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年没怕烟花，就送一朵朋友拍的烟花给大家吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期题图：Photo By 吴奇峰▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnTuq23tq2oxIWbLREFIfInr0NvU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> 《局部乐观》做到第10期的感受（对一个3分钟热度的ISFJ真的很不容易！！）&amp;送海报！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎇🎇嘉宾场，开启！🎇🎇</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 蓝放映室，</span><strong><span>凯凯</span></strong><span>『蓝还是很纯粹，也是不忘初心了』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 梦游俱乐部，</span><strong><span>牛牛</span></strong><span>『梦游饭店改名为梦游俱乐部了，赋予了它更多的意义』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> TAa cafe，</span><strong><span>阿卷</span></strong><span>『能把TAa做到现在这种程度，我是很自豪的』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> </span><strong><span>66</span></strong><span>，『大知闲闲，小知间间，保有内心的从容与广阔，力量将会慢慢流向于你』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> </span><strong><span>叶园</span></strong><span>，酒后的嘚瑟『终于找到自己的步调，我太开心了！』</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>😆😆好友场，惊喜！😆😆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> </span><strong><span>嘉嘉</span></strong><span>，『节目更新的时候，我应该正在巴塞罗那看画展』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> </span><strong><span>星星</span></strong><span>，『洛阳有一所医院的特殊儿童干预做得很好，洛阳还有一所全纳学校』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> </span><strong><span>馨元</span></strong><span>，『2025希望可以办画展，一场艺术疗愈工作坊，谈莱雅琴给大家听』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3153">52:33</a> </span><strong><span>阿洲</span></strong><span>，『一个不会滑板、机车、攀岩、浆板，拳击的摄影师不是合格兽医』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> </span><strong><span>云忆</span></strong><span>，『2025年多多赚钱，如果，能找到另一半，也是最好的』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3497">58:17</a> </span><strong><span>养生跑者刘教练</span></strong><span>『更加专注去做自己，更有执行力』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3757">62:37</a> </span><strong><span>孙冲</span></strong><span>，『蹦蹦跳跳的地冲进一滩死水，不断搅拌，然后说，看吧，这里面相当的汹涌！』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4407">73:27</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>牙</span></strong><span>，『我是luna，阿心的老友，山东人』</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6666ab0c94977a26ef55ed8f/lsQeFZ0gC9IlU4E_Ixmk2ZfEBd-N.m4a" length="78541317" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:56</itunes:duration>
