  <item>
    <title>Ep04：洛阳帷幕戏剧｜400百万建剧场，做给洛阳人看的戏剧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a75a3033ddcbb53cda4c53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a75a3033ddcbb53cda4c53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好，这里是洛阳本地播客：《局部乐观》的第5期~👋👋</span></p><span></span><p><span>我竟然连周更啦，哈哈哈哈，给自己鼓鼓掌先👏👏👏👏</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期的聊天嘉宾，是洛阳帷幕戏剧中心的主理人/老板：习文浩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一位兼职主播（后期也可能会经常出现），内心充满了戏剧热情的文艺女青年：花语</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期的聊天非常特殊，在一种完全没有准备的情况下，我们三个人，聊戏剧，创造力，也聊租金，大环境。</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊天中，real又真诚的习导，重复着“演好戏，先做好人”的军艺传统；也会像解构《哈姆雷特》的剧本一样，不断消解着我对戏剧、创造力、以及喜剧的想象，和那些从书中看来的概念。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从洛阳市的高考传奇，到军艺毕业，成为开心麻花的签约演员；再回洛阳开帷幕，成为拥有三层1200平固定演出场地的戏剧中心老板，一句“一座城市，如果没有戏剧，它该多无趣”为他在洛阳打出一片天，让洛阳人在家门口就能看到丰富的戏剧演出。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>而经历过这一切的习文浩，才刚过30岁，平常穿着踢拉板，文化衫就能出门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果“外来可期”太过俗套，那就祝愿他永远保有“松弛的舞台状态，饱满的舞台热情”，所有的将来是自己的决定。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0KnhiYmE7fOE3TOQfyOBjae3FQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigCX_sd_5ssYH4qMvpi3uUmHmnz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FijnQ4g6BYmQqC1WibvhGHAWFFGY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0Vpy_6G1JCrPY8cjR5oaoW2mqx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmgXhVYWW6QRrXe2VfUSxrVU2Nw-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntULSkT_H6YKOkCng6yEJmr3tZq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 从引进开始，到做剧院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 剧本中的小人物，代表大时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 做了8年演员，在开心麻花继续待下去的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>《歌剧魅影》不能引进到洛阳的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 一个剧院每月的成本有多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 少儿培训的噱头比剧院大的多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 剧院干不过口才班，到底为啥？孩子家长一句话，习导就碎了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 1分钟教会你气沉丹田（理论➕实践）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 为什么现代话剧要带麦克风？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 帷幕给演员发工资有多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 帷幕招演员的标准，10选1？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 即兴工作坊怎么就招不到人？社交属性是问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 剧场初期的至暗时刻，激情与勇气是唯一干下去的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 合家欢 VS 文艺剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 新计划，10分钟莎士比亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 现代人的创造力真的被禁锢了么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2738">45:38</a> 帷幕真实的铁粉是老奶奶？客户画像到底是个啥东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a> 帷幕有没有大女主戏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 做戏得先让人看得起，票价不敢标高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3475">57:55</a> 场馆的设计都是为未来考虑，环绕剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3635">1:00:35</a> 从小的经历，上军艺，进开心麻花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4230">1:10:30</a>『学表演不是为了让你成为更好的演员，是为了让你成为更好的人』</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">1:18:30</a> 帷幕的作品就是给洛阳老百姓看的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4922">1:22:02</a> 抖音来客，不太行？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶🎶🎶🎶🎶</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期歌单：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《一天》黄宣</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《电线杆上的鸟》LUKY</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《怪天气》黄宣/9m88</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《漂流人间》Chinesefootball</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《我的世界》Vincent杨杰</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《浮夸》林峰</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh3U-8kr2HVdNfsCMyGfQmrwsJiP.m4a" length="127929322" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmxu3IWjxYQxXiIW5S9HhKR1qByu.png"/>
