  <item>
    <title>Ep03：从电影《蹼》聊起来| 拧巴又结实的勇气，串起了我们的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669b5ef837236c546e75cc68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669b5ef837236c546e75cc68</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jul 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，这里是洛阳本地播客：《局部乐观》的第四期~👋👋</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期聊天的嘉宾呢是两位年轻的创作者：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>在洛阳土生但非土长的，女性电影导演：王芯芯🙋‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>原籍云南红河，目前常驻洛阳的文学创作者：左小白（白峰瑞）🙋‍♂️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们因为一部电影短片《蹼》坐在了一起，聊家乡，聊创作，聊二十六七的她/他们的现在，也聊未来</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>如果你也是创作者，或者也曾离开家乡，才渐渐看清故乡的意义，那么大概会了解，在聊天中两个还不到30岁的年轻话语中，那种拧巴又结实的勇气。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我倾佩她/他们的才华，更羡慕她/他们迄今为止好像浓缩了别人好几辈子人生的丰富经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近听到一句话</span><strong><span>“人生的经历，没有好坏之分，只有深浅，深刻的经历在长远来看，总会带来益处。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我相信这个道理，也祝愿《蹼》在奖运爆棚🏆️🏆️🏆️，可以成为一阵微风，吹散眼前迷雾 : )</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>更多精彩的内容，大家听播客喽~也欢迎留言互动，每条必回</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>爱你们~💗💗💗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrmEg9XH8aiQLCLO3CQtGlfxZKNq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fns8dCuHVVYzIHqpDXc8fgHr4uZ0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frbp1Bt2l4wLt16472bnEViHjfPc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGwQo8RFbltWGqzy5-glrsfgzFu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 关于洛阳的关键词：平静，安全感，小城镇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">9:15</a> 通过电影来讲家庭，女性与中国文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 通过创作赚钱or纯技能输出？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 两位的认识与世界的随机性，游戏中的一张水卡换来一个剧本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 离开家乡，是命运还是选择？是否还会想念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 在美国介绍家乡，我很官方，很骄傲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 云南红河“很颠，很荒谬”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 一个城市为什么吸引你留下来？我们身上是否还有小镇青年的印记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 河南话土？rimachua，操蛋，真幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 为了成为导演，被命运改变了MBTI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> 热爱非主流文学，不装逼要死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 在创作中越紧张越疯狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201600">56:00:00</a> 电影创作中的偶像，诺兰，顾长卫与贾樟柯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 写作中的张枣，加缪与米兰昆德拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">1:01:45</a> 电影被看懂了，感同身受就很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4040">1:07:20</a> 作为创作者，简单介绍自己就很好（女性导演，一个写小说的）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4835">1:20:35</a> 洛阳与美国的穷鬼乐园（旧金山的ocean beach 与洛阳小摊、想象书店）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>🎼🎼🎼🎼</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期歌单：</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>显然乐队《钥匙掉了谁来救我》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Yes《roundabout》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>苏运莹《等风停》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>落日飞车《Burgundy Red》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>野外合作社《南京之声》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>范晓萱/左小祖咒《你之所以是你》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>米津玄师《Lemon》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>郑宜农《Castle》</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/livzL8Cm-iX56MQejWKjgs9u6g-s.m4a" length="86468449" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:29:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlV3Q1cATQv_lTN5wHHhl1TG3IAK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep02：梦游饭店 | 洛阳的深夜食堂，滑板，梦想与生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668a3ef1ae8e21859a12a8e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668a3ef1ae8e21859a12a8e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，这里是《局部乐观》的第三期~👋🏻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在第一期就立下flag不会周更的我，终于在两期之后摸索出了最适合我更新节奏：半月更，也就是两周一更：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的对谈嘉宾是来自洛阳『梦游饭店』的夫妻档主理人：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“商业奇才”牛牛🙋🏻‍♀️与喜欢滑板的阿聂🛹</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们从梦游，聊到洛阳；旅游推荐，从家庭聊到梦想遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span>天马行空，轻松又real</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目有丢丢长，但绝不枯燥无聊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>就让我们一起，开始梦游吧~</span></strong><span>✨✨✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnd-phvnq6TGaheDlAYVuTHQjjkH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmGRwyhLl6X6U1X8uEIyDIuE-VRA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuER-nF2H7I-Xc26ddIoFmGqw-sp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsopqIT1vM2QrpqtvlFSUOYOP0tx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 一眼望到头的日子好么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 自己，老婆，孩子，狗，在家中的重要性排序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 梦游饭店缘起，两个版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 好爱的意义，对自己最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 一个工作一个上班，是绝妙搭配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 开心快乐，是所有事情的前提，也能传递给客人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 夫妻开店＝分手厨房现实版？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a> 自我与孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> &nbsp;梦游营业时间的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">53:30</a> 如何确定自己与一座城市的适配度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> 对于年轻的定义狭窄了，会后悔么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">1:08:00</a> 留下还是离开，给毕业季的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4305">1:11:45</a> 外地游客来洛，本地吃喝玩乐推荐（龙门石窟，大众精酿，烧烤，涮牛肚，水席，酱肉卷饼，塔西，酸浆牛肉火锅，米线，麻辣面）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">1:18:30</a> 梦游饭店新菜设想，泡面缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4950">1:22:30</a> 洛阳有意思的人/店/组织（月牙旧物，漫画店，秘密爱人乐队，斟郇合唱团，帷幕话剧）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5200">1:26:40</a> 要为热爱买单</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>🎼本期歌单：</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>落日飞车《My Jinji》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>SoulFa 灵魂沙发《Lover song》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>岑宁儿《ride》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>康姆士乐团《你要如何，我们就如何》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>杨乃文 《我们》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Deep East Music《mountain top 》</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls3qvW7QSO3Qw9LejmBqcTytG1-M.m4a" length="91260990" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvI1wHS6gsMAVHRWzxEtzevVoGfS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep01 ：对话凯凯| 在蓝放映室“快乐没有平静重要”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667a94d51d87fbc3610821f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667a94d51d87fbc3610821f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 09:58:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>第二期局部乐观终于来啦！</span></strong></p><p><span>这期是以对谈的形式，和洛阳『蓝放映室』的主理人凯凯，聊了天。（过程非常愉快，时不时爆笑）</span></p><p><span>作为一个完全由个人组织的放映室，至今</span><strong><span>凯凯已经在蓝放映了300期电影</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>由此积累起的洛阳年轻群体，也逐渐成为洛阳文艺与迷影圈的重要力量。</span></p><p><span>如果你爱电影，请一定要去蓝~</span></p><p><span>如果你爱摄影，请一定要去蓝~</span></p><p><span>所有的理由不多说，都在本期播客里了~</span></p><p><span>那么，我们开始吧～</span></p><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpSrL3PfVtl6Uw0uUduTkwdmzeG.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHSooLeCrfBY6YpLpZMkZZtiG7p.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPGuDGxX5EWO-duGkaLBAwllXEU.jpg"></figure><p><span>▼▼▼▼▼▼</span></p><p><span>『时间轴』</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 快问快答环节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 因为电影来蓝，因为空间爱上蓝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 拍照是源自家人的建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 因为看电影，拍照一上手就很顺</span></p><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> &nbsp;怎么看待用爱好去赚钱？</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 蓝的契机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 蓝每周放什么片？如何挑选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 能记住每一个来看电影的人的名字？是天赋？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 在洛阳放文艺片，大家会觉得看不懂？个人爱好与大众爱好的矛盾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 映后谈不是上课发言，别紧张😰。哪种观众最对凯凯的心？</span></p><p><span>观众是松散的好友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 自由职业的焦虑，他却乐在其中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 凯凯，究极I人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 局部乐观？还是底色忧郁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 很稳的外在，在生活里控制欲望，在创作里主动放弃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 如果有一天蓝不存在了，会是因为什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> 第二期嘉宾提前预定？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> 洛阳不缺年轻人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3627">60:27</a> 主播的小彩蛋</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvgWkS4cfL5gV3-ygnm24xqQKsSq.m4a" length="61060087" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofyUNX-KAMPfmgg0YYyTpFK8f6S.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep00：30+女性，有点反骨，在3线城市的周末想法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6666bc4563c334a2fb809a44</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6666bc4563c334a2fb809a44</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2024 08:41:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这是一个迟到了2年的播客节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>节目的名字《局部乐观》源自2年前</span></p><span></span><p><span>还不能自由移动时，与朋友隔空对对话产生的思想火花</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都不是非常乐观的人，但又经常觉得要支棱起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，也算是</span><strong><span>『偶尔支棱，局部乐观』</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中间搁置的时间，心里一直觉得有点对不起自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天终于又拾起来开始做</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然变成了一个人（以后必定会有搭子的）</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是终于做出来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来，很简单就是坚持更新吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>周更？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不太现实？</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈哈哈哈哈哈，尽量</span></p><span></span><p><span>↓↓↓</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> &nbsp;录制的初衷，因为开始双休啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> &nbsp;介绍一下自己。从北京，上海，回到河南，洛阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 『剩余价值』，是我的初恋。之琪，适野与建国在节目里的大笑，一直是我的白月光。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> &nbsp;关于失去，之琪、大壹与道长，两种不同的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> &nbsp;关于在公众平台上的表达，几次不太成熟的小尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;为什么做播客？ 自问根本原因，想好好照顾自己的情绪。当下的情绪是日常，可记录；沉淀后的感受，是方向，值得表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> &nbsp;是谁在监视我：晚上下决心改变，白天无脑按部就班……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> &nbsp;准备播客，从写逐字稿开始……98%的逐字稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> &nbsp;终于回洛阳定居，在轨道上找旷野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> &nbsp;把自己的生活过成风筝，是我截止目前对自己的人生交代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;“表达者的宿命”？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> &nbsp;以『高光时刻』结个尾吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> &nbsp;钱婧老师让我茅塞顿开，T人觉醒</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li2n-x-aJ6IqbSPVHilbWtxDH7B0.m4a" length="15897955" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLHA0Ci29Nwku7PccQNM1KHQu0G.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
